<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Cementos Chihuahua Q2 EPS eases.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Cementos Chihuahua Q2 EPS eases.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Cementos de Chihuahua SA's second-quarter earnings fell to 0.118 pesos per share from 0.133 pesos in the second quarter of 1996, a director of the Mexican company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The director said sales for the most recent quarter rose 10.8 percent to 349.5 million pesos.</p>
<p>Operating profit slipped to 82.3 million pesos, 5.7 percent less than the 87.3 million pesos recorded for the April-through-June period last year. ((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7902))</p>
